            300: "<p>Resonate MP4 specializes in providing cutting-edge telematics and asset management solutions tailored for the aviation industry. The XOPS platform was developed to optimize productivity, performance, and safety for airport authorities, airlines, and the ground handling community. It offers a comprehensive, unified solution that covers all critical operational activities, such as motorized and non-motorized equipment tracking, maintenance management, GSE task allocation, indoor-outdoor tracking, and CCTV surveillance.</p>
